            "heading": "2. Expressing Concentration — Master Formulas",
            "headingHinglish": "2. Expressing Concentration — Master Formulas",
            "body": "1. **Mass Percentage (% w/w):** (Mass of solute / Total mass of solution) × 100\n2. **Parts per Million (ppm):** (Mass of solute / Total mass of solution) × 10⁶\n3. **Mole Fraction (x_B):** n_B / (n_A + n_B)  *(Always **x_A + x_B = 1**!)*\n4. **Molarity (M):** (w_B / M_B) × (1000 / V_mL)  *(Unit: mol/L or M)*\n5. **Molality (m):** (w_B / M_B) × (1000 / W_A in g)  *(Unit: mol/kg or m)*\n\n### Temperature Dependence (Exam Favourite!):\n- **Temperature-DEPENDENT:** **Molarity (M)** aur **% v/v** (kyunki inmein **Volume** aata hai, aur garmi se liquid expand hota hai!).\n- **Temperature-INDEPENDENT:** **Molality (m)**, **Mole Fraction (x)**, **Mass % (w/w)**, **ppm** (kyunki inmein sirf **Mass** aata hai!).",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Mass Percentage (% w/w):** (Mass of solute / Total mass of solution) × 100\n2. **Parts per Million (ppm):** (Mass of solute / Total mass of solution) × 10⁶\n3. **Mole Fraction (x_B):** n_B / (n_A + n_B)  *(Always **x_A + x_B = 1**!)*\n4. **Molarity (M):** (w_B / M_B) × (1000 / V_mL)  *(Unit: mol/L or M)*\n5. **Molality (m):** (w_B / M_B) × (1000 / W_A in g)  *(Unit: mol/kg or m)*\n\n### Temperature Dependence (Exam Favourite!):\n- **Temperature-DEPENDENT:** **Molarity (M)** aur **% v/v** (kyunki inmein **Volume** aata hai, aur garmi se liquid expand hota hai!).\n- **Temperature-INDEPENDENT:** **Molality (m)**, **Mole Fraction (x)**, **Mass % (w/w)**, **ppm** (kyunki inmein sirf **Mass** aata hai!)."
