            "bodyHinglish": "| Unit | Formula | Temp Dependent? |\n|---|---|---|\n| Mass % (w/w) | (w_B / W_sol) × 100 | No |\n| ppm | (w_B / W_sol) × 10⁶ | No |\n| Mole fraction (x_B) | n_B / (n_A + n_B) | No |\n| Molarity (M) | n_B / V_sol(L) | **YES** (uses volume!) |\n| Molality (m) | n_B / W_solvent(kg) | **No** (preferred in thermodynamics/colligative!) |"
