            "bodyHinglish": "Chemistry class mein **Vipin** ne teacher ma'am ke board par do ajeeb mixing experiments dekhe:\n- Jab **n-hexane** aur **n-heptane** milaye gaye, to na solution garam hua, na thanda (ΔH_mix = 0), aur total volume exact sum ke barabar raha (ΔV_mix = 0)!\n- Par jab **Acetone** aur **Chloroform** milaye gaye, to beaker halka **garam** ho gaya (ΔH_mix < 0) aur vapour pressure ummeed se **kam** aaya!\n\nTeacher ma'am boli: \"Yeh sab **Raoult's Law** aur **Intermolecular Forces (A–B vs A–A, B–B)** ka khel hai! Aaj hum **Ideal Solutions**, **Non-Ideal Solutions (+ve & −ve deviations)** aur **Azeotropes** seekhenge!\""
