            "heading": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "body": "- **Vapour Pressure (p):** Bandh bartan mein constant temperature par liquid ke saath equilibrium mein maujood uski vapour dwara lagaya gaya pressure.\n- **Raoult's Law (Volatile Liquids):** Solution mein har volatile component ka partial vapour pressure uske pure vapour pressure (p°) aur mole fraction (x) ke product ke barabar hota hai: **p_A = p_A° x_A**.\n- **Ideal Solution:** Aisa solution jo har concentration par Raoult's law ko exact follow kare (**ΔH_mix = 0**, **ΔV_mix = 0**, A–B forces ≈ A–A & B–B forces).\n- **Azeotrope (Constant Boiling Mixture):** Aisa binary liquid mixture jiski liquid aur vapour phase mein **composition bilkul SAME** hoti hai aur jo ek fixed constant temperature par boil hota hai (fractional distillation se alag **nahi** ho sakta!).",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Vapour Pressure (p):** Bandh bartan mein constant temperature par liquid ke saath equilibrium mein maujood uski vapour dwara lagaya gaya pressure.\n- **Raoult's Law (Volatile Liquids):** Solution mein har volatile component ka partial vapour pressure uske pure vapour pressure (p°) aur mole fraction (x) ke product ke barabar hota hai: **p_A = p_A° x_A**.\n- **Ideal Solution:** Aisa solution jo har concentration par Raoult's law ko exact follow kare (**ΔH_mix = 0**, **ΔV_mix = 0**, A–B forces ≈ A–A & B–B forces).\n- **Azeotrope (Constant Boiling Mixture):** Aisa binary liquid mixture jiski liquid aur vapour phase mein **composition bilkul SAME** hoti hai aur jo ek fixed constant temperature par boil hota hai (fractional distillation se alag **nahi** ho sakta!)."
