            "headingHinglish": "1. Raoult's Law for Two Volatile Liquids (A and B)",
            "body": "Maan lo do volatile liquids A aur B (pure vapour pressures **p_A°** aur **p_B°**) ke mole fractions **x_A** aur **x_B** (**x_A + x_B = 1**) hain:\n- **p_A = p_A° x_A**   aur   **p_B = p_B° x_B**\n- Dalton's law of partial pressures se **Total Vapour Pressure**:\n\n**P_total = p_A + p_B = p_A° x_A + p_B° x_B = p_B° + (p_A° − p_B°) x_A**\n\n*(Note: Raoult's law is a special case of Henry's law jahan K_H = p°!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "Maan lo do volatile liquids A aur B (pure vapour pressures **p_A°** aur **p_B°**) ke mole fractions **x_A** aur **x_B** (**x_A + x_B = 1**) hain:\n- **p_A = p_A° x_A**   aur   **p_B = p_B° x_B**\n- Dalton's law of partial pressures se **Total Vapour Pressure**:\n\n**P_total = p_A + p_B = p_A° x_A + p_B° x_B = p_B° + (p_A° − p_B°) x_A**\n\n*(Note: Raoult's law is a special case of Henry's law jahan K_H = p°!)*"
