            "heading": "Common Exam Mistakes (Watch Out!)",
            "headingHinglish": "Aam Galtiyan (Common Mistakes)",
            "body": "1. **+ve deviation ko Maximum-boiling azeotrope se jod dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Positive deviation = maximum-boiling azeotrope!\n   - *Sahi:* Bilkul ULTA! +ve deviation mein **vapour pressure ZYADA** hota hai ⟹ liquid jaldi boil hota hai ⟹ **MINIMUM-boiling azeotrope**! (−ve deviation → **MAXIMUM-boiling azeotrope**!)\n2. **Chloroform + Acetone ko +ve deviation bol dena:**\n   - *Sahi:* Chloroform + Acetone mein naya **H-bond** banta hai ⟹ stronger attraction ⟹ **Negative (−ve) deviation**!\n3. **Azeotrope ko fractional distillation se alag karwana:**\n   - *Sahi:* Azeotrope ke components ko **fractional distillation se alag NAHI kiya ja sakta**, kyunki liquid aur vapour mein unka ratio bilkul same hota hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **+ve deviation ko Maximum-boiling azeotrope se jod dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Positive deviation = maximum-boiling azeotrope!\n   - *Sahi:* Bilkul ULTA! +ve deviation mein **vapour pressure ZYADA** hota hai ⟹ liquid jaldi boil hota hai ⟹ **MINIMUM-boiling azeotrope**! (−ve deviation → **MAXIMUM-boiling azeotrope**!)\n2. **Chloroform + Acetone ko +ve deviation bol dena:**\n   - *Sahi:* Chloroform + Acetone mein naya **H-bond** banta hai ⟹ stronger attraction ⟹ **Negative (−ve) deviation**!\n3. **Azeotrope ko fractional distillation se alag karwana:**\n   - *Sahi:* Azeotrope ke components ko **fractional distillation se alag NAHI kiya ja sakta**, kyunki liquid aur vapour mein unka ratio bilkul same hota hai!"
