            "heading": "Quick Recap",
            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "| Concept | Key Formula / Fact |\n|---|---|\n| Raoult's Law | p_A = p_A° x_A; P_total = p_B° + (p_A° − p_B°) x_A |\n| Ideal Solution | ΔH_mix = 0, ΔV_mix = 0 (Benzene + Toluene, Hexane + Heptane) |\n| +ve Deviation | A–B weaker; P↑, ΔH > 0, ΔV > 0 → **Min-boiling azeotrope** (Ethanol + Water/Acetone) |\n| −ve Deviation | A–B stronger; P↓, ΔH < 0, ΔV < 0 → **Max-boiling azeotrope** (CHCl₃ + Acetone, HNO₃ + H₂O) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Concept | Key Formula / Fact |\n|---|---|\n| Raoult's Law | p_A = p_A° x_A; P_total = p_B° + (p_A° − p_B°) x_A |\n| Ideal Solution | ΔH_mix = 0, ΔV_mix = 0 (Benzene + Toluene, Hexane + Heptane) |\n| +ve Deviation | A–B weaker; P↑, ΔH > 0, ΔV > 0 → **Min-boiling azeotrope** (Ethanol + Water/Acetone) |\n| −ve Deviation | A–B stronger; P↓, ΔH < 0, ΔV < 0 → **Max-boiling azeotrope** (CHCl₃ + Acetone, HNO₃ + H₂O) |"
