            "body": "Lab report dekh kar **Vivek** chaunk gaya: 1 kg paani mein **1 mole Glucose** gholne par freezing point **1.86 °C** gira, par 1 kg paani mein **1 mole NaCl** gholne par freezing point lagbhag **3.72 °C (DOUBLE!)** gir gaya! Aur doosri taraf, benzene mein **Acetic acid (CH₃COOH)** gholne par freezing point ummeed se **AADHA** gira!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Colligative properties **particles ki ginti** par depend karti hain! Paani mein 1 NaCl toot kar **2 ions (Na⁺ + Cl⁻)** banata hai (**Dissociation**), jabki benzene mein 2 acetic acid molecules H-bonding se judkar **1 dimer** bana lete hain (**Association**)! Isse molar mass galat (**Abnormal**) aata hai — aur ise theek karne ke liye 1880 mein **van't Hoff** ne **van't Hoff Factor (i)** diya!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Lab report dekh kar **Vivek** chaunk gaya: 1 kg paani mein **1 mole Glucose** gholne par freezing point **1.86 °C** gira, par 1 kg paani mein **1 mole NaCl** gholne par freezing point lagbhag **3.72 °C (DOUBLE!)** gir gaya! Aur doosri taraf, benzene mein **Acetic acid (CH₃COOH)** gholne par freezing point ummeed se **AADHA** gira!\n\nTeacher ma'am muskurayi: \"Colligative properties **particles ki ginti** par depend karti hain! Paani mein 1 NaCl toot kar **2 ions (Na⁺ + Cl⁻)** banata hai (**Dissociation**), jabki benzene mein 2 acetic acid molecules H-bonding se judkar **1 dimer** bana lete hain (**Association**)! Isse molar mass galat (**Abnormal**) aata hai — aur ise theek karne ke liye 1880 mein **van't Hoff** ne **van't Hoff Factor (i)** diya!\""
