            "heading": "Chapter Summary & Wrap-Up",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter Ka Saar: Solutions",
            "body": "| Topic | Mukhya Formula / Niyam | Yaad Rakhne Ki Khaas Baat |\n|---|---|---|\n| Concentration Units | M = n/V(L); m = n/W_A(kg); x_A + x_B = 1 | **M** is temp-dependent; **m, x, %w/w, ppm** are temp-independent |\n| Solubility & Henry's Law | p = K_H x | Higher K_H = Lower solubility; T↑ → gas solubility↓ |\n| Raoult's Law & Azeotropes | P = p_A° x_A + p_B° x_B; y_A = p_A/P | +ve dev → min-boiling azeotrope; −ve dev → max-boiling azeotrope |\n| 4 Colligative Properties | RLVP = i x_B; ΔT_b = i K_b m; ΔT_f = i K_f m; π = i C R T | Osmotic pressure best for proteins; RO uses P > π |\n| van't Hoff Factor (i) | i = M_norm / M_obs; Dissoc: i = 1+(n−1)α; Assoc: i = 1−α(1−1/n) | Dissociation → i > 1; Association → i < 1 |\n\n---\n\nAb tum Solutions ke sabhi concentration units, Henry's Law, Raoult's Law, Colligative Properties aur van't Hoff Factor ko poori tarah master kar chuke ho!\n\n**Agle chapter mein:** Chemical energy se electricity kaise banti hai (Galvanic Cells, Batteries, Fuel Cells) aur electricity se chemical reactions kaise chalaye jaate hain (Electrolysis) — padhenge **Electrochemistry**!",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Topic | Mukhya Formula / Niyam | Yaad Rakhne Ki Khaas Baat |\n|---|---|---|\n| Concentration Units | M = n/V(L); m = n/W_A(kg); x_A + x_B = 1 | **M** is temp-dependent; **m, x, %w/w, ppm** are temp-independent |\n| Solubility & Henry's Law | p = K_H x | Higher K_H = Lower solubility; T↑ → gas solubility↓ |\n| Raoult's Law & Azeotropes | P = p_A° x_A + p_B° x_B; y_A = p_A/P | +ve dev → min-boiling azeotrope; −ve dev → max-boiling azeotrope |\n| 4 Colligative Properties | RLVP = i x_B; ΔT_b = i K_b m; ΔT_f = i K_f m; π = i C R T | Osmotic pressure best for proteins; RO uses P > π |\n| van't Hoff Factor (i) | i = M_norm / M_obs; Dissoc: i = 1+(n−1)α; Assoc: i = 1−α(1−1/n) | Dissociation → i > 1; Association → i < 1 |\n\n---\n\nAb tum Solutions ke sabhi concentration units, Henry's Law, Raoult's Law, Colligative Properties aur van't Hoff Factor ko poori tarah master kar chuke ho!\n\n**Agle chapter mein:** Chemical energy se electricity kaise banti hai (Galvanic Cells, Batteries, Fuel Cells) aur electricity se chemical reactions kaise chalaye jaate hain (Electrolysis) — padhenge **Electrochemistry**!"
