            "body": "Raoult's law + Dalton's law: **x_A = p_A / p_A° = (y_A P_total) / p_A°**, aur **x_B = (y_B P_total) / p_B°**.\nSince **x_A + x_B = 1**:\n\n```\n   1 / P_total = (y_A / p_A°) + (y_B / p_B°)\n```",
            "bodyHinglish": "Raoult's law + Dalton's law: **x_A = p_A / p_A° = (y_A P_total) / p_A°**, aur **x_B = (y_B P_total) / p_B°**.\nSince **x_A + x_B = 1**:\n\n```\n   1 / P_total = (y_A / p_A°) + (y_B / p_B°)\n```"
