            "bodyHinglish": "Agar volume V₁ (molarity M₁, factor i₁) aur volume V₂ (molarity M₂, factor i₂) ke do non-reacting solutions milaye jaayein:\n\n```\n   π_mix = [ (i₁ M₁ V₁ + i₂ M₂ V₂) / (V₁ + V₂) ] × R T\n```"
