            "body": "Chemistry lab mein teacher ma'am ne ek beaker mein Zinc strip ko ZnSO₄ solution mein aur doosre beaker mein Copper strip ko CuSO₄ solution mein rakha, aur dono ko U-shaped **Salt Bridge** se joda (safe low-voltage teacher demo). **Girja** ne dekha ki voltmeter ne exact **1.10 V** dikhaya — par jaise hi ma'am ne ZnSO₄ mein thoda paani milakar uska concentration kam kiya, voltage 1.10 V se **badh** gaya!\n\nClass 11 mein tumne [Redox Reactions](../../../class11/chemistry/redox-reactions/redox-reactions.md) mein galvanic cell aur electrode potential ki shuruat padhi thi. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Standard Hydrogen Electrode (SHE)** aur **Nernst Equation** se kisi bhi concentration par exact cell voltage calculate karna seekhenge!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chemistry lab mein teacher ma'am ne ek beaker mein Zinc strip ko ZnSO₄ solution mein aur doosre beaker mein Copper strip ko CuSO₄ solution mein rakha, aur dono ko U-shaped **Salt Bridge** se joda (safe low-voltage teacher demo). **Girja** ne dekha ki voltmeter ne exact **1.10 V** dikhaya — par jaise hi ma'am ne ZnSO₄ mein thoda paani milakar uska concentration kam kiya, voltage 1.10 V se **badh** gaya!\n\nClass 11 mein tumne [Redox Reactions](../../../class11/chemistry/redox-reactions/redox-reactions.md) mein galvanic cell aur electrode potential ki shuruat padhi thi. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **Standard Hydrogen Electrode (SHE)** aur **Nernst Equation** se kisi bhi concentration par exact cell voltage calculate karna seekhenge!"
