            "bodyHinglish": "Ek jewellery workshop mein **Kalawati** ne dekha ki artisan ne ek peetal (brass) ke chammach ko silver-salt solution mein cathode banakar latkaya aur DC current chalaya — 15 minute mein chammach par chamakdaar **chaandi (Ag)** ki ek patli uniform parat chadh gayi!\n\nClass 10 mein tumne [Electrolysis](../../../class10/chemistry/electrolysis/electrolysis.md) ki basic kahani padhi thi. Aaj Class 12 mein hum **exact kitne gram metal deposit hoga** yeh calculate karne wale **Faraday's Laws of Electrolysis** aur **Products of Electrolysis** seekhenge!"
