            "heading": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (New Words)",
            "body": "- **Primary Battery:** Non-rechargeable cell jismein reaction sirf ek baar hoti hai (e.g., Dry cell, Mercury cell).\n- **Secondary Battery:** Rechargeable cell jise bahar se reverse current dekar wapas charge kiya ja sakta hai (e.g., Lead-storage battery, Ni-Cd cell, Li-ion battery).\n- **Fuel Cell:** Aisa galvanic cell jo fuel (H₂, CH₄) ke combustion ki energy ko seedha electricity mein badalta hai (~70% efficiency, zero pollution!).\n- **Corrosion (Rusting):** Metal ka hawa aur nami (O₂ + H₂O) ke saath dheere-dheere electrochemical oxidation hokar kharaab hona (Iron → Rust **Fe₂O₃·xH₂O**).",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Primary Battery:** Non-rechargeable cell jismein reaction sirf ek baar hoti hai (e.g., Dry cell, Mercury cell).\n- **Secondary Battery:** Rechargeable cell jise bahar se reverse current dekar wapas charge kiya ja sakta hai (e.g., Lead-storage battery, Ni-Cd cell, Li-ion battery).\n- **Fuel Cell:** Aisa galvanic cell jo fuel (H₂, CH₄) ke combustion ki energy ko seedha electricity mein badalta hai (~70% efficiency, zero pollution!).\n- **Corrosion (Rusting):** Metal ka hawa aur nami (O₂ + H₂O) ke saath dheere-dheere electrochemical oxidation hokar kharaab hona (Iron → Rust **Fe₂O₃·xH₂O**)."
