            "headingHinglish": "1. Primary Batteries (Use Once!)",
            "body": "1. **Dry Cell (Leclanché Cell — ~1.5 V, clocks & remotes):**\n   - **Anode:** Zinc container (**Zn → Zn²⁺ + 2e⁻**)\n   - **Cathode:** Carbon (graphite) rod surrounded by powdered **MnO₂ + C**\n   - **Electrolyte:** Moist paste of **NH₄Cl + ZnCl₂**\n   - **Cathode reaction:** **MnO₂ + NH₄⁺ + e⁻ → MnO(OH) + NH₃** (NH₃ forms complex [Zn(NH₃)₄]²⁺ with Zn²⁺!).\n2. **Mercury Cell (~1.35 V — watches, hearing aids):**\n   - **Anode:** Zn-Hg amalgam; **Cathode:** Paste of HgO + C; **Electrolyte:** KOH + ZnO paste.\n   - **Overall reaction:** **Zn(Hg) + HgO(s) → ZnO(s) + Hg(l)**.\n   - **Special Advantage:** Overall reaction mein **koi aqueous ion involved nahi hai** jiska concentration badle — isliye iska **voltage poori life exact constant (1.35 V)** rehta hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Dry Cell (Leclanché Cell — ~1.5 V, clocks & remotes):**\n   - **Anode:** Zinc container (**Zn → Zn²⁺ + 2e⁻**)\n   - **Cathode:** Carbon (graphite) rod surrounded by powdered **MnO₂ + C**\n   - **Electrolyte:** Moist paste of **NH₄Cl + ZnCl₂**\n   - **Cathode reaction:** **MnO₂ + NH₄⁺ + e⁻ → MnO(OH) + NH₃** (NH₃ forms complex [Zn(NH₃)₄]²⁺ with Zn²⁺!).\n2. **Mercury Cell (~1.35 V — watches, hearing aids):**\n   - **Anode:** Zn-Hg amalgam; **Cathode:** Paste of HgO + C; **Electrolyte:** KOH + ZnO paste.\n   - **Overall reaction:** **Zn(Hg) + HgO(s) → ZnO(s) + Hg(l)**.\n   - **Special Advantage:** Overall reaction mein **koi aqueous ion involved nahi hai** jiska concentration badle — isliye iska **voltage poori life exact constant (1.35 V)** rehta hai!"
