            "headingHinglish": "2. Secondary Batteries (Rechargeable!)",
            "body": "### Lead Storage Battery (Car / Inverter — 6 cells × 2 V = 12 V):\n- **Anode:** Lead grid (**Pb**); **Cathode:** Lead grid packed with **PbO₂**; **Electrolyte:** **38% H₂SO₄** solution (acidic — never open a car battery!).\n- **Discharging Reactions:**\n  - Anode: **Pb(s) + SO₄²⁻(aq) → PbSO₄(s) + 2e⁻**\n  - Cathode: **PbO₂(s) + SO₄²⁻(aq) + 4 H⁺(aq) + 2e⁻ → PbSO₄(s) + 2 H₂O(l)**\n  - **Overall (Discharging):** **Pb + PbO₂ + 2 H₂SO₄ → 2 PbSO₄ + 2 H₂O**\n  *(Discharging mein H₂SO₄ consume hota hai ⟹ electrolyte ki density ghatti hai!)*\n- **Charging:** Bahar se reverse voltage lagane par upar wali poori reaction **exact ULTI** chalti hai — **PbSO₄** wapas **Pb** aur **PbO₂** ban jaata hai aur H₂SO₄ regenerate ho jaata hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "### Lead Storage Battery (Car / Inverter — 6 cells × 2 V = 12 V):\n- **Anode:** Lead grid (**Pb**); **Cathode:** Lead grid packed with **PbO₂**; **Electrolyte:** **38% H₂SO₄** solution (acidic — never open a car battery!).\n- **Discharging Reactions:**\n  - Anode: **Pb(s) + SO₄²⁻(aq) → PbSO₄(s) + 2e⁻**\n  - Cathode: **PbO₂(s) + SO₄²⁻(aq) + 4 H⁺(aq) + 2e⁻ → PbSO₄(s) + 2 H₂O(l)**\n  - **Overall (Discharging):** **Pb + PbO₂ + 2 H₂SO₄ → 2 PbSO₄ + 2 H₂O**\n  *(Discharging mein H₂SO₄ consume hota hai ⟹ electrolyte ki density ghatti hai!)*\n- **Charging:** Bahar se reverse voltage lagane par upar wali poori reaction **exact ULTI** chalti hai — **PbSO₄** wapas **Pb** aur **PbO₂** ban jaata hai aur H₂SO₄ regenerate ho jaata hai!"
