            "bodyHinglish": "Silver-Silver Chloride electrode (**AgCl(s) + e⁻ → Ag(s) + Cl⁻**) aur **Ag⁺ + e⁻ → Ag(s)** ko subtract karne par milta hai:\n**AgCl(s) ⇌ Ag⁺(aq) + Cl⁻(aq)** (n = 1, K = K_sp!):\n\n```\n   E°(Cl⁻/AgCl/Ag) = E°(Ag⁺/Ag) + 0.059 log K_sp\n```"
