        "summaryHinglish": "Ramila ek pharmaceutical quality-control lab ke seminar mein gayi thi, jahan expiry date calculate karne ka tareeka bataya gaya. Quality manager ne samjhaya: \"Kisi medicine ki shelf-life pata karne ke",
