            "body": "Reetu ek chemical engineering workshop mein thi jahan benzene ke chlorination reactor mein ek saath do products ban rahe the (parallel reactions) aur ek product aage aur react karke unwanted by-product bana raha tha (consecutive reactions). Engineer ne bataya: \"Agar tumhe desired product ki maximum yield chahiye, toh sirf ek rate constant nahi — parallel aur sequential rate constants ke exact differential equations solve karne padte hain!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Reetu ek chemical engineering workshop mein thi jahan benzene ke chlorination reactor mein ek saath do products ban rahe the (parallel reactions) aur ek product aage aur react karke unwanted by-product bana raha tha (consecutive reactions). Engineer ne bataya: \"Agar tumhe desired product ki maximum yield chahiye, toh sirf ek rate constant nahi — parallel aur sequential rate constants ke exact differential equations solve karne padte hain!\""
