            "bodyHinglish": "Sajni ki chemistry class mein teacher ma'am ne glass shield ke peeche ek safe demonstration dikhaya (strictly teacher demo — kyunki K₂Cr₂O₇ aur concentrated acids toxic aur corrosive hote hain, students unhe directly nahi chhoote). Ma'am ne orange potassium dichromate solution mein thoda base (NaOH) dala — turant solution chamakdar **peela (yellow)** ho gaya! Phir usmein dilute acid dala — wapas **narangi (orange)** ho gaya! Doosre beaker mein gehre baingani (deep purple) KMnO₄ ne acidic FeSO₄ solution mein girte hi apna rang kho diya!\n\nAaj hum in dono jaadui colour changes aur unke exact balanced redox equations ka raaz samjhenge!"
