            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (Key Terms)",
            "body": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Chromite Ore (FeCr₂O₄)** | Chromium ka mukhya ore jisse K₂Cr₂O₇ banaya jata hai |\n| **Chromate Ion (CrO₄²⁻)** | Yellow tetrahedral ion jo alkaline (basic) medium mein stable hota hai |\n| **Dichromate Ion (Cr₂O₇²⁻)** | Orange ion (do tetrahedra ek O-atom se jude) jo acidic medium mein stable hota hai |\n| **Pyrolusite Ore (MnO₂)** | Manganese ka mukhya ore jisse KMnO₄ banaya jata hai |\n| **Manganate Ion (MnO₄²⁻)** | Dark green paramagnetic ion (Mn in +6 state, 1 unpaired e⁻) |\n| **Permanganate Ion (MnO₄⁻)** | Deep purple diamagnetic ion (Mn in +7 state, 0 unpaired e⁻) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Chromite Ore (FeCr₂O₄)** | Chromium ka mukhya ore jisse K₂Cr₂O₇ banaya jata hai |\n| **Chromate Ion (CrO₄²⁻)** | Yellow tetrahedral ion jo alkaline (basic) medium mein stable hota hai |\n| **Dichromate Ion (Cr₂O₇²⁻)** | Orange ion (do tetrahedra ek O-atom se jude) jo acidic medium mein stable hota hai |\n| **Pyrolusite Ore (MnO₂)** | Manganese ka mukhya ore jisse KMnO₄ banaya jata hai |\n| **Manganate Ion (MnO₄²⁻)** | Dark green paramagnetic ion (Mn in +6 state, 1 unpaired e⁻) |\n| **Permanganate Ion (MnO₄⁻)** | Deep purple diamagnetic ion (Mn in +7 state, 0 unpaired e⁻) |"
