            "body": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Inner Transition Elements (f-Block)** | Woh elements jinka last electron ante-penultimate **(n−2)f** subshell mein bharta hai |\n| **Lanthanoids (4f series)** | Cerium (Ce, Z = 58) se Lutetium (Lu, Z = 71) tak ke 14 elements (Lanthanum La = 57 ko bhi saath study kiya jata hai) |\n| **Actinoids (5f series)** | Thorium (Th, Z = 90) se Lawrencium (Lr, Z = 103) tak ke 14 radioactive elements (Actinium Ac = 89 ke baad) |\n| **Lanthanoid Contraction** | La se Lu tak atomic aur ionic radii mein hone wali steady (lagatar) kami, jo 4f electrons ki poor shielding ki wajah se hoti hai |\n| **Actinoid Contraction** | Ac se Lr tak hone wali size ki kami (5f electrons ki shielding 4f se bhi kharab hone ki wajah se yeh contraction aur zyada tez hoti hai) |\n| **Mischmetall** | Lanthanoid metals (~95%) + Iron (~5%) + traces of S, C, Ca, Al ka alloy (lighter flints aur Mg alloys mein use hota hai) |",
