        "summaryHinglish": "Sashi apne school ke material science exhibition mein ek \"Mystery Metal Detective\" booth chala rahi thi. Visitors ko 4 clues milte the: (1) metal ka +2 ion 5 unpaired electrons rakhta hai, (2) iska +7",
