        "summaryHinglish": "Sima ek inorganic research lab mein thi jahan chemist ne white Cu₂SO₄ ko paani mein ghola — aur kuch hi seconds mein neela Cu²⁺ solution aur laal-bhoora metallic copper powder niche baith gaya! Sima n",
