            "heading": "Key Vocabulary & Terms",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (Key Terms)",
            "body": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Double Salt** | Do simple salts ka addition compound jo paani mein poori tarah apne individual ions mein toot jata hai (jaise Mohr's salt, Carnallite, Potash alum) |\n| **Coordination Compound (Complex)** | Woh compound jismein central metal atom/ion fixed number of ligands se coordinate bonds dwara juda hota hai aur paani mein apni pehchan (identity) banaye rakhta hai |\n| **Central Metal Atom/Ion** | Coordination entity ke beech ka metal (usually d-block) jo ligands se electron pairs accept karta hai (Lewis acid) |\n| **Ligand** | Woh neutral molecule ya anion jo central metal ko ek ya zyada lone pairs donate karta hai (Lewis base) |\n| **Denticity** | Ek ligand mein kitne donor atoms ek saath central metal se bond bana sakte hain |\n| **Chelate Ligand** | Di- ya polydentate ligand jo central metal ke saath ek stable ring structure (chelate ring) banata hai |\n| **Coordination Number (CN)** | Central metal atom/ion se directly jude hue **ligand donor atoms (sigma bonds)** ki total sankhya |\n| **Coordination Sphere** | Square brackets [ ... ] ke andar likha gaya central metal aur uske directly bonded ligands; bahar wale ions **counter ions** kehlate hain |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Double Salt** | Do simple salts ka addition compound jo paani mein poori tarah apne individual ions mein toot jata hai (jaise Mohr's salt, Carnallite, Potash alum) |\n| **Coordination Compound (Complex)** | Woh compound jismein central metal atom/ion fixed number of ligands se coordinate bonds dwara juda hota hai aur paani mein apni pehchan (identity) banaye rakhta hai |\n| **Central Metal Atom/Ion** | Coordination entity ke beech ka metal (usually d-block) jo ligands se electron pairs accept karta hai (Lewis acid) |\n| **Ligand** | Woh neutral molecule ya anion jo central metal ko ek ya zyada lone pairs donate karta hai (Lewis base) |\n| **Denticity** | Ek ligand mein kitne donor atoms ek saath central metal se bond bana sakte hain |\n| **Chelate Ligand** | Di- ya polydentate ligand jo central metal ke saath ek stable ring structure (chelate ring) banata hai |\n| **Coordination Number (CN)** | Central metal atom/ion se directly jude hue **ligand donor atoms (sigma bonds)** ki total sankhya |\n| **Coordination Sphere** | Square brackets [ ... ] ke andar likha gaya central metal aur uske directly bonded ligands; bahar wale ions **counter ions** kehlate hain |"
