        "summaryHinglish": "Sulochana ne apne hospital ke cancer-awareness bulletin board par ek molecule dekha: [Pt(NH₃)₂Cl₂]. Neeche do chote diagrams bane the: ek mein dono Cl atoms ek hi side par the (cisplatin) aur doosre m",
