            "body": "Sulochana ne apne hospital ke cancer-awareness bulletin board par ek molecule dekha: [Pt(NH₃)₂Cl₂]. Neeche do chote diagrams bane the: ek mein dono Cl atoms ek hi side par the (**cisplatin**) aur doosre mein dono Cl ek-doosre ke bilkul opposite the (**transplatin**). Poster par likha tha: \"Cisplatin duniya ki sabse successful anti-cancer medicines mein se ek hai, jabki transplatin cancer par bilkul asar nahi karta!\" Sulochana soch mein pad gayi — formula wahi, atoms wahi, sirf 3D position badalne se itna bada farq?!\n\nYahi hai **Isomerism in Coordination Compounds** ki taqat!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Sulochana ne apne hospital ke cancer-awareness bulletin board par ek molecule dekha: [Pt(NH₃)₂Cl₂]. Neeche do chote diagrams bane the: ek mein dono Cl atoms ek hi side par the (**cisplatin**) aur doosre mein dono Cl ek-doosre ke bilkul opposite the (**transplatin**). Poster par likha tha: \"Cisplatin duniya ki sabse successful anti-cancer medicines mein se ek hai, jabki transplatin cancer par bilkul asar nahi karta!\" Sulochana soch mein pad gayi — formula wahi, atoms wahi, sirf 3D position badalne se itna bada farq?!\n\nYahi hai **Isomerism in Coordination Compounds** ki taqat!"
