            "bodyHinglish": "Sunny apne school trip par mineral museum gaya tha. Guide ne do keemti patthar dikhaye: laal **Ruby** (Al₂O₃ mein thoda Cr³⁺) aur hara **Emerald** (beryl mineral mein wahi Cr³⁺!). Sunny ne poocha, \"Dono mein wahi Cr³⁺ ion hai, phir ruby laal aur emerald hara kyun hai?\" Guide ne bataya: \"Cr³⁺ ke aas-paas ke ligands badal gaye — ligands ki taqat badalne se Cr³⁺ ke d-orbitals ki **splitting energy (Δₒ)** badal jati hai, aur isliye absorb hone wala rang badal jata hai!\"\n\nAaj hum VBT aur CFT dono ko bilkul clean steps mein master karenge!"
