        "summaryHinglish": "Surinder apne university ke chemistry olympiad prep workshop mein tha. Mentor ne board par ek single mystery complex likha: \"Formula: CoCl₃·4NH₃. Yeh excess AgNO₃ ke saath sirf 1 mole AgCl deta hai, i",
