            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (Revision Snapshot)",
            "body": "Is wrap-up topic mein hum saare tools ko ek saath lagayenge:\n- **Werner:** AgCl moles = ionisable Cl⁻ outside [ ... ].\n- **IUPAC:** Alphabetical ligands → metal (−ate if anionic) → Roman numeral OS.\n- **Isomerism:** Structural (4 types) + Geometrical (cis/trans, fac/mer; never tetrahedral) + Optical (chiral: [M(AA)₃], cis-[M(AA)₂b₂]).\n- **VBT & CFT:** Strong ligand (CN⁻, CO, en, NH₃) → Δₒ > P → low-spin/inner orbital; Weak ligand (F⁻, Cl⁻, H₂O) → Δₒ < P → high-spin/outer orbital; Δₜ = (4/9) Δₒ.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Is wrap-up topic mein hum saare tools ko ek saath lagayenge:\n- **Werner:** AgCl moles = ionisable Cl⁻ outside [ ... ].\n- **IUPAC:** Alphabetical ligands → metal (−ate if anionic) → Roman numeral OS.\n- **Isomerism:** Structural (4 types) + Geometrical (cis/trans, fac/mer; never tetrahedral) + Optical (chiral: [M(AA)₃], cis-[M(AA)₂b₂]).\n- **VBT & CFT:** Strong ligand (CN⁻, CO, en, NH₃) → Δₒ > P → low-spin/inner orbital; Weak ligand (F⁻, Cl⁻, H₂O) → Δₒ < P → high-spin/outer orbital; Δₜ = (4/9) Δₒ."
