        "summaryHinglish": "Tej ek organometallic chemistry seminar mein tha jahan professor ne 3 isoelectronic carbonyls dikhaye: [V(CO)₆]⁻, [Cr(CO)₆], aur [Mn(CO)₆]⁺. Teeno octahedral hain aur teeno mein exact 18 valence elect",
