            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Haloalkane (Alkyl Halide, R–X)** | Aliphatic hydrocarbon ka halogen derivative jismein X atom sp³-hybridised carbon se juda hota hai |\n| **Haloarene (Aryl Halide, Ar–X)** | Aromatic ring (benzene) ka halogen derivative jismein X atom seedha ring ke sp²-hybridised carbon se juda hota hai |\n| **Allylic Halide** | Woh halide jismein X atom aise sp³ carbon se juda ho jo C=C double bond ke **theek bagal** mein ho (CH₂=CH–CH₂–X) |\n| **Benzylic Halide** | Woh halide jismein X atom aise sp³ carbon se juda ho jo benzene ring se directly juda ho (C₆H₅–CH₂–X) |\n| **Vinylic Halide** | Woh halide jismein X atom seedha C=C double bond ke **sp² carbon** se juda ho (CH₂=CH–X) |\n| **Geminal (gem-) Dihalide** | Do halogen atoms **ek hi carbon** par jude hon (e.g., CH₃–CHCl₂, ethylidene chloride) |\n| **Vicinal (vic-) Dihalide** | Do halogen atoms **bagal-bagal (adjacent) carbons** par jude hon (e.g., Cl–CH₂–CH₂–Cl, ethylene dichloride) |"
