        "summaryHinglish": "Ajit apne doston ke saath organic chemistry ka \"Conversion Relay\" khel raha tha. Rule simple tha: start molecule se target molecule tak kam se kam steps mein pahunchna! Sawal aaya: \"Propene se Propan-",
