            "bodyHinglish": "Ajit apne doston ke saath organic chemistry ka \"Conversion Relay\" khel raha tha. Rule simple tha: start molecule se target molecule tak kam se kam steps mein pahunchna! Sawal aaya: \"Propene se Propan-1-ol banao!\" Ajit ne do steps mein game jeet liya: Step 1 — HBr + peroxide (anti-Markovnikov) se 1-bromopropane; Step 2 — aqueous KOH (SN2) se Propan-1-ol! Yahi hai organic synthesis ka maza — ek reaction ka product agle ka reactant ban jata hai!"
