            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Intermolecular Hydrogen Bonding** | Alag-alag molecules ke –OH groups ke beech ka strong electrostatic attraction (high BP aur water solubility ka kaaran) |\n| **Intramolecular Hydrogen Bonding** | Ek hi molecule ke andar do groups (jaise o-nitrophenol mein –OH aur –NO₂) ke beech H-bond (is se BP ghat jata hai → steam volatile!) |\n| **Phenoxide Ion (C₆H₅–O⁻)** | Phenol se H⁺ nikalne par bana conjugate base, jo benzene ring par resonance se behad stable hota hai |\n| **pKₐ Value** | Acid strength ka logarithmic measure (pKₐ = −log Kₐ): **Jitna chhota pKₐ, utna zyada strong acid!** |"
