            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Anu ek pharmaceutical museum tour par gayi thi jahan duniya ki sabse mashhoor painkiller **Aspirin** banane ki poori kahani likhi thi: Phenol ko NaOH aur CO₂ ke saath heat karke **Salicylic acid** banaya jata hai (**Kolbe's reaction**), aur phir uska acetic anhydride se acetylation karne par **Aspirin** (acetylsalicylic acid) banti hai! Ek chhote se benzene ring + OH se itni badi dawai!\n\n> **Safety Note:** Concentrated H₂SO₄, conc. HNO₃, bromine water, CHCl₃, aur conc. HI corrosive/toxic reagents hain; yeh sabhi reactions theoretical study ya supervised industrial/teacher demonstrations ke liye hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Anu ek pharmaceutical museum tour par gayi thi jahan duniya ki sabse mashhoor painkiller **Aspirin** banane ki poori kahani likhi thi: Phenol ko NaOH aur CO₂ ke saath heat karke **Salicylic acid** banaya jata hai (**Kolbe's reaction**), aur phir uska acetic anhydride se acetylation karne par **Aspirin** (acetylsalicylic acid) banti hai! Ek chhote se benzene ring + OH se itni badi dawai!\n\n> **Safety Note:** Concentrated H₂SO₄, conc. HNO₃, bromine water, CHCl₃, aur conc. HI corrosive/toxic reagents hain; yeh sabhi reactions theoretical study ya supervised industrial/teacher demonstrations ke liye hain."
