            "bodyHinglish": "Aradhana ne apni organic chemistry notebook ke last page par ek \"Master Conversion Map\" banaya: ek corner par **Propene**, beech mein **Phenol**, aur doosre corner par **Aspirin** aur **Anisole**! Har arrow par sirf reagent likha tha — aur dekhte hi dekhte poora chapter ek single connected network ban gaya! Aaj hum usi network se top-tier conversions aur reasoning solve karenge!"
