            "bodyHinglish": "Jab alcohol ka acid-catalysed dehydration carbocation intermediate se guzarta hai, toh agar bagal ke carbon se **1,2-Hydride shift (H⁻)** ya **1,2-Methyl shift (CH₃⁻)** ya **Ring expansion** (4 → 5 ya 5 → 6 membered ring) se **zyada stable carbocation** ban sakta ho, toh rearrangement hamesha hota hai!\n- **Example (Neopentyl alcohol):** (CH₃)₃C–CH₂–OH —(H⁺, Δ)→ [(CH₃)₃C–CH₂⁺ (1°)] —(1,2-methyl shift)→ (CH₃)₂C⁺–CH₂CH₃ (3°) → **(CH₃)₂C=CH–CH₃ (2-Methylbut-2-ene, major!)**.\n- **Ring expansion:** Cyclobutylmethanol + H⁺/Δ → cyclopentyl carbocation → **Cyclopentene (major!)**."
