        "summaryHinglish": "Balbir apni dadi ke kitchen mein baking ke dauran teen alag-alag khushbooein mehsoos kar raha tha: cake mein vanilla (vanillin — ek aldehyde), chai ke masale mein dalchini (cinnamaldehyde — ek aldehyd",
