            "bodyHinglish": "Balbir apni dadi ke kitchen mein baking ke dauran teen alag-alag khushbooein mehsoos kar raha tha: cake mein **vanilla** (vanillin — ek aldehyde), chai ke masale mein **dalchini** (cinnamaldehyde — ek aldehyde), badam ke essence mein **benzaldehyde**, aur achaar mein khatta **sirka** (acetic acid — ek carboxylic acid)! In sabhi molecules ke beech ek hi common heart dhadakta hai — **Carbonyl Group (C=O)**!"
