            "bodyHinglish": "Basant ne apni study desk ke saamne ek colourful chart chipkaya tha: \"Benzaldehyde banane ke 4 raaste!\" Acid chloride se **Rosenmund**, cyanide se **Stephen**, toluene se **Etard**, aur seedha benzene se **Gattermann–Koch**! Basant ne dekha ki har reaction mein ek hi smart trick hai — **reaction ko aldehyde stage par rokna**, taki woh aage alcohol ya carboxylic acid na ban jaye!"
