            "heading": "Key Vocabulary & Terms",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (Key Terms)",
            "body": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Rosenmund Reduction** | Acid chloride (R–COCl) + H₂ over **Pd–BaSO₄** (poisoned catalyst) → **Aldehyde (R–CHO)** |\n| **Stephen Reaction** | Nitrile (R–CN) + **SnCl₂ / HCl** → imine hydrochloride —(H₃O⁺)→ **Aldehyde (R–CHO)** |\n| **DIBAL-H** | Diisobutylaluminium hydride [AlH(i-Bu)₂] — selective reducing agent jo nitriles aur esters ko **aldehydes** par rok deta hai (bina C=C tode!) |\n| **Etard Reaction** | Toluene + **CrO₂Cl₂ (chromyl chloride) in CS₂**, phir H₃O⁺ → **Benzaldehyde** |\n| **Gattermann–Koch Reaction** | Benzene + **CO + HCl** (anhyd. AlCl₃ / CuCl) → **Benzaldehyde** |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Rosenmund Reduction** | Acid chloride (R–COCl) + H₂ over **Pd–BaSO₄** (poisoned catalyst) → **Aldehyde (R–CHO)** |\n| **Stephen Reaction** | Nitrile (R–CN) + **SnCl₂ / HCl** → imine hydrochloride —(H₃O⁺)→ **Aldehyde (R–CHO)** |\n| **DIBAL-H** | Diisobutylaluminium hydride [AlH(i-Bu)₂] — selective reducing agent jo nitriles aur esters ko **aldehydes** par rok deta hai (bina C=C tode!) |\n| **Etard Reaction** | Toluene + **CrO₂Cl₂ (chromyl chloride) in CS₂**, phir H₃O⁺ → **Benzaldehyde** |\n| **Gattermann–Koch Reaction** | Benzene + **CO + HCl** (anhyd. AlCl₃ / CuCl) → **Benzaldehyde** |"
