            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Nucleophilic Addition** | Carbonyl carbon (>C=O) par nucleophile (Nu⁻) ka attack (sp² planar → sp³ tetrahedral) — aldehydes & ketones ki signature reaction |\n| **Clemmensen Reduction** | >C=O → >CH₂ using **Zn–Hg / conc. HCl** (acid-sensitive groups ke liye mat use karo!) |\n| **Wolff–Kishner Reduction** | >C=O → >CH₂ using **NH₂–NH₂ (hydrazine) + KOH / ethylene glycol (Δ)** (base-sensitive groups ke liye mat use karo!) |\n| **Tollens' Reagent** | Ammoniacal silver nitrate [Ag(NH₃)₂]⁺ — **SABHI aldehydes** (aliphatic + aromatic) iske saath **silver mirror** dete hain; ketones nahi! |\n| **Fehling's Solution** | Alkaline CuSO₄ + Rochelle salt (Cu²⁺) — sirf **aliphatic aldehydes** reddish-brown Cu₂O ppt dete hain (**benzaldehyde NAHI deta!**) |\n| **Aldol Condensation** | **α-Hydrogen wale** aldehydes/ketones + dilute NaOH → β-hydroxy aldehyde/ketone (aldol) —(Δ)→ α,β-unsaturated carbonyl! |\n| **Cannizzaro Reaction** | **BINA α-Hydrogen wale** aldehydes (HCHO, C₆H₅CHO) + **conc. NaOH (50%)** → disproportionation (1 mol alcohol + 1 mol carboxylate salt!) |"
