            "body": "Birendra ke chemistry club mein \"5-Minute Mystery Vial\" challenge chal raha tha: 4 colourless vials — **Propanal, Propanone, Benzaldehyde, aur Benzoic acid** — bina label ke rakhe the! Birendra ne sirf 3 reagents se sab pehchan liye: (1) **NaHCO₃** ne turant **Benzoic acid** (CO₂ bubbles!) alag kiya; (2) **Tollens'** ne **Propanone** (no silver mirror!) alag kiya; (3) **Fehling's** ne **Propanal** (red-brown ppt) ko **Benzaldehyde** (no ppt) se alag kar diya! Poora puzzle 1 minute mein khatam!",
