            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (Key Terms)",
            "body": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Amine** | Ammonia (NH₃) ka organic derivative jismein 1, 2, ya 3 H-atoms alkyl/aryl groups se replace kiye gaye hon |\n| **Primary (1°) Amine** | NH₃ ka 1 H replace hua ho (**R–NH₂** ya **Ar–NH₂**) |\n| **Secondary (2°) Amine** | NH₃ ke 2 H replace hue hon (**R–NH–R'**) |\n| **Tertiary (3°) Amine** | NH₃ ke teeno H replace hue hon (**R₃N**) |\n| **Quaternary Ammonium Salt** | Nitrogen par 4 alkyl groups + positive charge (**R₄N⁺ X⁻**) |\n| **Pyramidal Geometry** | Amines mein sp³ nitrogen (3 bond pairs + 1 lone pair) ka 3D shape (bond angle ~108° in (CH₃)₃N) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Term | Hinglish Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Amine** | Ammonia (NH₃) ka organic derivative jismein 1, 2, ya 3 H-atoms alkyl/aryl groups se replace kiye gaye hon |\n| **Primary (1°) Amine** | NH₃ ka 1 H replace hua ho (**R–NH₂** ya **Ar–NH₂**) |\n| **Secondary (2°) Amine** | NH₃ ke 2 H replace hue hon (**R–NH–R'**) |\n| **Tertiary (3°) Amine** | NH₃ ke teeno H replace hue hon (**R₃N**) |\n| **Quaternary Ammonium Salt** | Nitrogen par 4 alkyl groups + positive charge (**R₄N⁺ X⁻**) |\n| **Pyramidal Geometry** | Amines mein sp³ nitrogen (3 bond pairs + 1 lone pair) ka 3D shape (bond angle ~108° in (CH₃)₃N) |"
