            "body": "1. **Reduction of Nitriles (Ascent / Step-Up by +1 Carbon!):**\n   **R–C≡N —(H₂/Ni, or LiAlH₄, or Na(Hg)/C₂H₅OH)→ R–CH₂–NH₂** (pure 1° amine with **same carbons as R–CN**, i.e., **+1 carbon** over R–X!).\n2. **Reduction of Amides (Same Number of Carbons):**\n   **R–CONH₂ —(1. LiAlH₄ / ether, 2. H₂O)→ R–CH₂–NH₂**",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Reduction of Nitriles (Ascent / Step-Up by +1 Carbon!):**\n   **R–C≡N —(H₂/Ni, or LiAlH₄, or Na(Hg)/C₂H₅OH)→ R–CH₂–NH₂** (pure 1° amine with **same carbons as R–CN**, i.e., **+1 carbon** over R–X!).\n2. **Reduction of Amides (Same Number of Carbons):**\n   **R–CONH₂ —(1. LiAlH₄ / ether, 2. H₂O)→ R–CH₂–NH₂**"
