            "bodyHinglish": "**R–CO–NH₂ + Br₂ + 4NaOH → R–NH₂ + Na₂CO₃ + 2NaBr + 2H₂O**\n- **Magic:** Carbonyl group (**–CO–**) gayab ho jata hai (as Na₂CO₃), aur **1° amine** milta hai jismein amide se **1 carbon KAM** hota hai!\n- **Works for BOTH aliphatic AND aromatic 1° amines!**\n  - Ethanamide (CH₃CONH₂) → **Methanamine (CH₃NH₂)**\n  - Propanamide (CH₃CH₂CONH₂) → **Ethanamine (CH₃CH₂NH₂)**\n  - Benzamide (C₆H₅CONH₂) → **Aniline (C₆H₅NH₂)**!"
