            "body": "1. **Gabriel phthalimide se aniline ya 2° amine bana dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Phthalimide + C₆H₅Cl → Aniline.\n   - *Sahi:* Gabriel phthalimide **SIRF 1° ALIPHATIC amines** banata hai — na aniline, na 2°/3° amines!\n\n2. **Hoffmann bromamide mein carbon count same rakh dena:**\n   - *Galat:* CH₃CH₂CONH₂ + Br₂ + NaOH → CH₃CH₂CH₂NH₂.\n   - *Sahi:* Hoffmann bromamide **1 carbon KAM** karta hai → **CH₃CH₂NH₂ (ethanamine)**!\n\n3. **Ammonolysis ko pure 1° amine banane ka best method bol dena:**\n   - *Galat:* R–X + NH₃ sirf 1° amine deta hai.\n   - *Sahi:* Ammonolysis 1°, 2°, 3° aur R₄N⁺X⁻ ka mixture deta hai; pure 1° aliphatic amine ke liye **Gabriel phthalimide** best hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **Gabriel phthalimide se aniline ya 2° amine bana dena:**\n   - *Galat:* Phthalimide + C₆H₅Cl → Aniline.\n   - *Sahi:* Gabriel phthalimide **SIRF 1° ALIPHATIC amines** banata hai — na aniline, na 2°/3° amines!\n\n2. **Hoffmann bromamide mein carbon count same rakh dena:**\n   - *Galat:* CH₃CH₂CONH₂ + Br₂ + NaOH → CH₃CH₂CH₂NH₂.\n   - *Sahi:* Hoffmann bromamide **1 carbon KAM** karta hai → **CH₃CH₂NH₂ (ethanamine)**!\n\n3. **Ammonolysis ko pure 1° amine banane ka best method bol dena:**\n   - *Galat:* R–X + NH₃ sirf 1° amine deta hai.\n   - *Sahi:* Ammonolysis 1°, 2°, 3° aur R₄N⁺X⁻ ka mixture deta hai; pure 1° aliphatic amine ke liye **Gabriel phthalimide** best hai!"
