        "summaryHinglish": "Gudiya ne apne study group mein \"3-Step Aromatic Challenge\" rakha: \"Nitrobenzene se m-Bromophenol banao!\" Sab soch mein pad gaye kyunki –OH toh o,p-directing hai! Gudiya ne smile karke trick dikhayi: ",
