            "body": "| Goal / Test | Key Reagent / Result |\n|---|---|\n| Step-up amine (+1 C) | R–X → **KCN** → R–CN → **LiAlH₄ / H₂-Ni** → R–CH₂NH₂ |\n| Step-down amine (−1 C) | R–CONH₂ + **Br₂ + 4NaOH** → R–NH₂ (**Hoffmann bromamide**) |\n| Pure 1° aliphatic amine | **Gabriel phthalimide** (NO aniline!) |\n| Distinguish 1° / 2° / 3° amines | **Hinsberg (C₆H₅SO₂Cl)**: 1° KOH-soluble, 2° KOH-insoluble, 3° no rxn |\n| Distinguish 1° vs 2°/3° | **Carbylamine (CHCl₃ + alc. KOH)**: 1° ONLY gives foul R–NC |\n| Distinguish Ar–NH₂ vs R–NH₂ | **Azo-dye test** (NaNO₂/HCl 0–5°C + β-naphthol): Ar–NH₂ → orange-red dye! |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Goal / Test | Key Reagent / Result |\n|---|---|\n| Step-up amine (+1 C) | R–X → **KCN** → R–CN → **LiAlH₄ / H₂-Ni** → R–CH₂NH₂ |\n| Step-down amine (−1 C) | R–CONH₂ + **Br₂ + 4NaOH** → R–NH₂ (**Hoffmann bromamide**) |\n| Pure 1° aliphatic amine | **Gabriel phthalimide** (NO aniline!) |\n| Distinguish 1° / 2° / 3° amines | **Hinsberg (C₆H₅SO₂Cl)**: 1° KOH-soluble, 2° KOH-insoluble, 3° no rxn |\n| Distinguish 1° vs 2°/3° | **Carbylamine (CHCl₃ + alc. KOH)**: 1° ONLY gives foul R–NC |\n| Distinguish Ar–NH₂ vs R–NH₂ | **Azo-dye test** (NaNO₂/HCl 0–5°C + β-naphthol): Ar–NH₂ → orange-red dye! |"
