            "heading": "Chapter Summary & Wrap-Up",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter Ka Saar (Amines Wrap-up)",
            "body": "| Topic | Key Reactions / Rules | Must-Remember Fact |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Structure & Naming | sp³ pyramidal N (~108°); 1°/2°/3° by C on N | (CH₃)₃C–NH₂ is **1°**; longest chain = parent alkanamine |\n| 2. Preparation | Fe/HCl, Gabriel phthalimide, Hoffmann bromamide | Gabriel = **1° aliphatic ONLY**; Hoffmann (Br₂/NaOH) = **−1 carbon**; RCN reduction = **+1 carbon** |\n| 3. Basicity & Tests | Gas: 3°>2°>1°; Water: **Ethyl 231, Methyl 213** | Aniline << NH₃; Carbylamine = 1° ONLY; Hinsberg = 1° soluble, 2° insoluble, 3° no rxn |\n| 4. Aniline EAS | Br₂/H₂O → tribromo; protect with (CH₃CO)₂O | Direct nitration → **47% meta**; Sulphanilic acid = zwitterion; **NO Friedel–Crafts** |\n| 5. Diazonium Salts | ArN₂⁺Cl⁻ (0–5°C, resonance stabilised) | Sandmeyer (Cu₂X₂/CuCN), KI, HBF₄ (F), **H₃PO₂ (Benzene)**, Phenol/Aniline azo dyes |\n\n---\n\nAb tumne Amines ke saare core concepts, basicity orders aur diazonium conversions master kar liye hain! Competitive exams (JEE/NEET) ke liye **Pyramidal Inversion, Ortho-Effect in Substituted Anilines (SIR/SIP), Basicity of Guanidine/Pyridine/Pyrrole, aur Hofmann Exhaustive Methylation** padhne ke liye [Amines — Gehrai Mein (Advanced Level)](amines-advanced.md) zaroor dekho.\n\n**Agle (aakhiri!) chapter mein:** Hum **Biomolecules** shuru karenge — jahan Carbohydrates, Proteins, Enzymes, Vitamins aur DNA/RNA ki zinda chemistry padhenge!",
