            "bodyHinglish": "Gyan ek physical-organic seminar mein ek paradoxical data point dekh raha tha: **o-Toluidine (2-methylaniline, pK_b = 9.56)** **aniline (pK_b = 9.38)** se KAM basic tha — jabki –CH₃ toh electron-donating group hai! Professor ne muskurakar kaha: \"Carboxylic acids mein ortho-effect acidity **badhata** hai, aur anilines mein wahi ortho-effect basicity **ghatata** hai — kyunki ortho group protonated **–NH₃⁺** ke hydration (solvation) ko rok deta hai (**SIP: Steric Inhibition of Protonation**)!\""
