            "body": "Jay apne school ke annual health camp mein doctor se pooch raha tha: \"Doctor uncle, hum Vitamin C roz nimbu ya santre se kyun lete hain, jabki Vitamin D aur A ki goli mahine mein ek baar bhi chal jati hai?\" Doctor ne muskura kar bataya: \"**Vitamin C paani mein ghul (water-soluble)** jata hai aur urine ke saath roz sharir se bahar nikal jata hai — isliye store nahi hota! Jabki **Vitamins A, D, E, K fat-soluble** hain aur liver mein store rehte hain!\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Jay apne school ke annual health camp mein doctor se pooch raha tha: \"Doctor uncle, hum Vitamin C roz nimbu ya santre se kyun lete hain, jabki Vitamin D aur A ki goli mahine mein ek baar bhi chal jati hai?\" Doctor ne muskura kar bataya: \"**Vitamin C paani mein ghul (water-soluble)** jata hai aur urine ke saath roz sharir se bahar nikal jata hai — isliye store nahi hota! Jabki **Vitamins A, D, E, K fat-soluble** hain aur liver mein store rehte hain!\""
